description: Boundaries between package core/ and lib/core/
globs: core/**/*.dart,lib/core/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---

# Core boundaries

- `package:core` (`core/`): networking, `Result`, storage, low-level utils.
- `lib/core/`: themes, env, gateway, app helpers.
- Remote DS JSON: `BaseRepository.parseResponse` — no private `_parseResponse`.
- Percent overlay: `WidgetUtils.showProgressLoading`. post/put/patch report `onSendProgress` when that overlay is visible.
- HTTP send/receive have no client timeout; server **408** is timeout.

Do not duplicate snackbar/utils across both. See `.agents/rules/core-boundaries.md`.
